---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for interpretReadiness. Read grower notes and approved assessment records to identify likely readiness, quality, and uncertainty. Distinguish tentative expectations from confirmed availability and preserve variety or lot differences that affect harvest timing and customer suitability. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
